Source: xr-wayland
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: bits <bigbits@hackx.cc>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo (>= 1.88), rustc (>= 1.88), python3, pkg-config, libxkbcommon-dev, librust-xr-shell-protocols-dev (= 0.2.0)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: xr-window-server
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, xr-shell (>= 0.2.0)
Recommends: xwayland
Description: Private Wayland and Xwayland application server for UKUI XR
 Owns application surfaces, configure serials and seat input on an isolated
 Wayland display. Exports immutable shared-memory snapshots to xr-shell.
 Supports text selections and input-method protocol integration.
 Installation starts no services and does not change the existing desktop.
